  "description": "⚔️ [Zonn Family] – United for Glory ⚔️\nWe are a dedicated band of adventurers aiming to conquer IdleMMO together!\nOur focus: teamwork, growth, and enjoying the grind while helping each other progress.\n\n📅 Guild Raids:\n\nTuesday – Thursday – Sunday – Legendary Raid \n\n🎯 Goals:\n\nComplete Guild Challenge Daily\n\nRank in the Top 50 Guilds leaderboard\n\nMaximize Guild Buffs for all members\n\n📜 Rules:\n\nBe active in raids and daily contributions\n\nRespect all members — no toxicity\n\nIdle is fine, but offline too long = kick\n\nJoin us, rise with us, and let’s leave our mark on IdleMMO!\n— “Strength in Unity, Glory in Battle”",
